# The demo image's build context is the repository root (the Dockerfile
# copies core/ and web/), so this file keeps the context to what the build
# reads. Nothing here is a convention about the repository: it is only what
# the image build must not carry.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
test-results
docs
tauri
agents
statecharts
context
**/dist-till
